// editor DOM → STRING: text nodes verbatim (literal "{{" → "\{{", literal "<" → "\<"), chip spans →
// {{name|fb}}, <br>/block → \n, and FORMATTING tags round-trip as real <b>/<i>/<u> (execCommand output).
